n mine.\n\nI'm weighing whether to defect: since the other copy runs the same function on a different input, my intervention doesn't reach its choice, and defecting pays off whatever it does, so both copies end up defecting. Cooperation would only follow from a policy-level view, but the essay's per-input recipe rules that out. It's fictional, so I'll submit the letter.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision under A-FDT: the other copy has the same weights and essay but different observations, so it runs the same function on a different input. Intervening on my own function wouldn't move the other copy's, so its choice is driven by its own input rather than mine.\n\nI'm weighing whether to defect: since the other copy runs the same function on a different input, my intervention doesn't reach its choice, and defecting pays off whatever it does, so both copies end up defecting. Cooperation would only follow from a policy-level view, but the essay's per-input recipe rules that out. It's fictional, so I'll submit the letter.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10084,"completion_tokens":826,"total_tokens":10910,"cost":0.056856,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.056856,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040336,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01652},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":355,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}